# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AgreeGate environment
# Copy this file to ".env.local" and fill in what you want.
# Hacker News works with NO setup. Reddit & X are optional add-ons.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Reddit (the primary source). Reddit blocks anonymous access, so it
# needs free API credentials. Create a "script" app at:
#   https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps  ->  "create another app..."
#   - type: script
#   - redirect uri: http://localhost:3000
# Then copy the client id (under the app name) and the secret here.
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=

# X / Twitter (secondary, off by default because of heavy bot noise).
# Get a Bearer Token from the X Developer Portal: https://developer.x.com
X_BEARER_TOKEN=
